---
import { CheckCircle, Award, Users } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="tentang" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-600 mb-6">
          <CheckCircle class="w-6 h-6" />
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Tentang Kami</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-6">
          Membangun Solusi Digital<br />untuk Masa Depan Anda
        </h2>

        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 text-lg">
          Perusahaan kami berdedikasi untuk membantu bisnis Anda menghadapi tantangan era digital dengan solusi yang inovatif, efisien, dan mudah diimplementasikan.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Dengan tim yang berpengalaman dan pendekatan yang klien-fokus, kami telah membantu ratusan perusahaan mencapai tujuan bisnis mereka melalui transformasi digital yang tepat sasaran.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600">
              <Award class="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Terpercaya</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Dengan integritas</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600">
              <Users class="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Tim Ahli</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Berpengalaman & sertifikasi</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
        <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-brand-600 rounded-2xl blur opacity-30"></div>
        <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/20 text-white">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white">
              <Users class="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-100 uppercase tracking-wider">Perusahaan</div>
              <div class="text-lg font-bold">PT Solusi Digital Indonesia</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs shrink-0 mt-1">1</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-white font-medium">10+ Tahun Pengalaman</div>
                <div class="text-blue-200 text-sm">Melayani berbagai industri dengan solusi terbaik</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs shrink-0 mt-1">2</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-white font-medium">500+ Klien Puas</div>
                <div class="text-blue-200 text-sm">Dari startup hingga perusahaan besar</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs shrink-0 mt-1">3</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-white font-medium">200+ Proyek</div>
                <div class="text-blue-200 text-sm">Berhasil diselesaikan tepat waktu</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>